{# ===========================================================================
   Component: preview-banner

   PREVIEW BRANCH ONLY: preview/location-photos. This whole file is deleted
   when the branch is deleted, and it must never reach main.

   Fixed to the top of the viewport on every page of this build, above the
   site header, in a colour combination that appears nowhere else in the brand
   system, so no screenshot of this deploy can be mistaken for production.

   It is a real <div> in the markup rather than a CSS pseudo-element, so it
   survives a print, a reader mode, and a screenshot, and it is announced to
   screen readers as a region rather than being invisible to them.

   It also pushes the document down by its own height rather than overlaying
   the header, because a banner that covers the nav is a banner someone will
   want removed.
   =========================================================================== #}
<div class="preview-flag" role="region" aria-label="Preview build notice">
  <p class="preview-flag__text">
    <strong>Preview build.</strong>
    Location photography is AI-enhanced and for review only.
  </p>
</div>
